{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t教宗良十四世成功接受手術切除部分右肺，組織檢測證實患有肺腺癌，醫療團隊正在等待進一步化驗結果，再決定後續治療方案。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n梵蒂岡表示，良十四世手術後，仍在羅馬的醫院休養，過去一晚有良好休息，沒有出現併發症。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n梵蒂岡已取消教宗截至本月20日的公開活動。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.294521+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:39:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:18:21.455408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:17.270981+00:00","content_hash":"31cc8f3a5a9fc858b16ee94eb9c3749c259bad5769325624e8d7276c5b5f361f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}